{"speciesId":184,"names":{"fr":"Azumarill","es":"Azumarill","en":"Azumarill","ja":"マリルリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"By keeping still and listening in­ tently, it can tell what is in even wild, fast- moving rivers."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"When it plays in water, it rolls up its elongated ears to prevent their insides from get­ ting wet."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The bubble-like pattern on its stomach helps it camouflage itself when it's in the water."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"AZUMARILL’s long ears are indispensable sensors. By focusing its hearing, this POKéMON can identify what kinds of prey are around, even in rough and fast-running rivers."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"AZUMARILL can make balloons out of air. It makes these air balloons if it spots a drowning POKéMON. The air balloons enable the POKéMON in trouble to breathe."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It lives in water virtually all day long. Its body color and pattern act as camouflage that makes it tough for enemies to spot in water."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"When it plays in water, it rolls up its elongated ears to prevent their insides from getting wet."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"By keeping still and listening intently, it can even tell what is in wild, fast-moving rivers."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives in rivers and lakes. In water, its coloring and patterns trick the vision of foes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of living things on riverbeds."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It can spend all day in water, since it can inhale and store a large volume of air."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"By keeping still and listening intently, it can tell what is in even wild, fast-moving rivers."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When it plays in water, it rolls up its elongated ears to prevent their insides from getting wet."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses poumons peuvent contenir assez d’air pour lui permettre de passer une journée sous l’eau."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can spend all day in water, since it can inhale and store a large volume of air."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses poumons peuvent contenir assez d’air pour lui permettre de passer une journée sous l’eau."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can spend all day in water, since it can inhale and store a large volume of air."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of things in water and tell what they are."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of things in water and tell what they are."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses longues oreilles font un radar efficace. Elles décèlent les mouvements dans le lit des rivières."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus largas orejas son sensores que pueden percibir movimientos de seres vivos en el lecho del río."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of living things on riverbeds."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"長い 耳は 優れた センサー。 川底で 動く 生き物の 音を 聞き分ける ことが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les motifs sur son ventre lui permettent de se camoufler lorsqu’il est dans l’eau."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Gracias al dibujo que tiene en el estómago, le resulta bastante fácil camuflarse en el agua."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The bubble-like pattern on its stomach helps it camouflage itself when it’s in the water."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"お腹の 泡のような 模様は 水の 中で 自分の 姿を カモフラージュ してくれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les longues oreilles d’Azumarill sont des capteurs indispensables. Lorsqu’il se concentre pour écouter, ce Pokémon peut identifier les proies aux alentours, même dans les cours d’eau à fort courant ou les rapides."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Azumarill puede hacer burbujas de aire si ve a algún Pokémon que esté a punto de ahogarse. Estas burbujas de aire son básicas para que los Pokémon puedan seguir respirando."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Azumarill’s long ears are indispensable sensors. By focusing its hearing, this Pokémon can identify what kinds of prey are around, even in rough and fast-running rivers."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"長い 耳は マリルリの 大事な センサー。 耳を 澄ませば 流れの 激しい 川でも そこに いる 獲物の 種類が わかるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Azumarill peut faire des bulles d’air. Il fabrique ces bulles lorsqu’il voit un Pokémon en train de se noyer. Les bulles d’air permettent au Pokémon en difficulté de respirer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Azumarill puede hacer burbujas de aire si ve a algún Pokémon que esté a punto de ahogarse. Estas burbujas de aire son básicas para que los Pokémon puedan seguir respirando."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Azumarill can make balloons out of air. It makes these air balloons if it spots a drowning Pokémon. The air balloons enable the Pokémon in trouble to breathe."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"空気の 風船を つくる ことが できる。 ポケモンが おぼれていると 空気玉を 出して 呼吸が できる ように してあげるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il passe la majeure partie de la journée dans l’eau. Quand il fait beau, il flotte à la surface pour prendre un bain de soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Pasa la mayor parte del tiempo en el agua. Los días despejados, aprovecha para tomar el sol flotando en la superficie."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It spends most of its time in the water. On sunny days, Azumarill floats on the surface of the water and sunbathes."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"１日の ほとんどを 水中で すごす。 晴れた 日には 水面に 浮かんで 日向ぼっこをする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il crée des bulles d’air dont il enveloppe gentiment les Azurill venus jouer dans la rivière."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Crea burbujas llenas de aire con las que cubre a los Azurill cuando juegan en el río."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"These Pokémon create air-filled bubbles. When Azurill play in rivers, Azumarill will cover them with these bubbles."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"空気が 詰まった 泡を 作る。 ルリリが 川で 遊ぶときは この 泡で 包んであげるのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":184,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",12],[23,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[3,"level-up",36],[4,"level-up",36],[5,"level-up",34],[6,"level-up",34],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",34],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",33],[9,"level-up",33],[10,"level-up",33],[11,"level-up",33],[12